Mathematical attribution
The mathematical results formalized in this package are from
"A Rationalization of the Weak Generalized Axiom of Revealed Preference"
by Victor H. Aguiar, Per Hjertstrand, Roberto Serrano, and Özgür Evren,
and the classical revealed-preference literature identified in the sources.
The mathematical proofs were developed by the authors. The Lean files
provide supplementary machine verification; this notice does not attribute
authorship of every Lean proof to every mathematical author.

